    "reviews": "\u201cPlayed this on mobile for years it's been my comfort game so glad it's on steam. It runs great and is better than I remember with all the added content.Ps. always feed buddy &lt;3\u201d<br>Kiwi<br><br>\u201cJust an ideal cozy game. A fun balance of challenge and simple gameplay that will let you get immersed in the cute world and surprisingly deep plot.\u201d<br>writerintheory<br><br>\u201c\u2018Good Pizza, Great Pizza\u2019 is an addictive but repetitive cooking sim with focus on accuracy and speed. Initially it came across as Bob\u2019s Burgers Pizza the game but very clearly has its own style completely full of charm.\u201d<br>Ghostie<br>",
